# =============================================================================
#  WONDER WOMAN - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Amazon")           Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "WonderWoman_Idle" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-360.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "WonderWoman_Idle" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, so legs/pelvis are keyed)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 360 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   360 frames = 6.0 s - proud, planted, heroic
#    stance  : wide planted feet (right foot slightly forward), chest lifted, chin up, fists on hips
#              (elbows flared), slow regal breath every 90 f
#    56-106  : right hand leaves the hip and takes up the lasso at her side
#    100-250 : LASSO TWIRL - the hand traces a closed ~0.45-stud circle at 2 Hz (period 30 f), shoulder drives,
#              forearm trails 5 f, wrist whips 10 f behind; her body answers with a faint counter-sway; head follows the rope
#    252-274 : the rope snaps taut - hand hauled back to the hip, chest recoils, one firm nod
#    290-352 : regal look-off to the side, then back to the camera, settling into the hero stance
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.
# =============================================================================
